  "name": "Beast Tamer",
  "perception": 12,
  "publicNotes": "<p>Beast tamers bring the wild to civilization, rearing and training creatures to follow their commands and perform flashy tricks that entertain audiences. The beast tamer typically fights alongside a trained animal ally of its level or lower, most likely a tiger (Monster Core 51).</p><hr /><p>Performances come in a wide variety of forms, from musical methods like singing and instruments to physical dancing and juggling to simple orating and conversing.</p>",
